{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Moussacre</strong></i> is a fast-paced 2D platformer inspired by classic cartoons; each animation being carefully drawn frame by frame. Run through levels at <i>blistering</i> speeds while slashing apart all who stand in your way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668740/extras/76bc8dadeebfa7693bd5bbf831282f5c.poster.avif?t=1755554170\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668740/extras/76bc8dadeebfa7693bd5bbf831282f5c.webm?t=1755554170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't your normal, family-friendly cartoon mouse. Meet <strong>MouseTrap</strong>, the <i>paint</i>-thirsty killing machine who yearns to steal victims' <strong>color</strong>. Prison was not nice to this poor soul. After being forced to star in cartoons for nearly a century, he completely overhauls his identity to break away from who he once was, eventually adopting his prison name, &quot;MouseTrap.&quot; This all leads to him executing his grand prison escape, finally being free from the clutches of his owners. Still dead set on filling his life with color, MouseTrap heads for the <strong>Prisma Fortress</strong>, a massive tower said to hold the ultimate source of color; the <strong>Prisma Diamond</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668740/extras/d7b05453b5850e4e1c95a4d6eaa1f295.poster.avif?t=1755554170\" width=522 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668740/extras/d7b05453b5850e4e1c95a4d6eaa1f295.webm?t=1755554170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> massive worlds, each with multiple objectives, clever secrets, and colorful characters to interact with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kill</strong> the powerful rulers of the fortress, each with a myriad of tricky tactics and devastating powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn</strong> the highest score, best time, or explore at your own pace.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2668740?t=1755554170","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668740/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755554170","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668740/4f5b3d536c5716ab8a4d7c3664085b43052de34b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755554170","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668740/4f5b3d536c5716ab8a4d7c3664085b43052de34b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755554170","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Cartoon violence; dismemberment and paint (equivalent to blood)"},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2734500,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Moussacre</strong></i> is a fast-paced 2D platformer inspired by classic cartoons; each animation being carefully drawn frame by frame. Run through levels at <i>blistering</i> speeds while slashing apart all who stand in your way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorig